{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>\n\n</p>\n<p>長鑫存儲官方回應道，本次是國產10667Mbps高速率LPDDR5X晶片首次量產應用。</p>\n<p>LPDDR5X內存單顆粒最高16Gb，相比市面主流8533Mbps版本帶寬提升約25%，同時功耗相比LPDDR5降低30%，兼顧高帶寬輸出與移動端續航表現。</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/0904/fcbc3bf25a2e57b.png\"/>\n</p>\n<p>據官方消息，努比亞NaviX Ultra已正式獲得入網許可證，將於9月上市。</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/0904/d305ef481601c8d.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/0904/fcbc3bf25a2e57b.png\"/>\n</p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-04T05:21:18.550308+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":161,"images":3,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"none"}}